      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Isuel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In her youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. She then became sovereign of her realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cillen",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A veteran in the struggle to reclaim Elven glory, nobody enters the forest without her knowledge.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Virgile",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A - INTRO - ELF",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord  \n\u0022We are to find and offer an Alliance to the Elves in this region. In time the Elven Alliance will be back to its former glory!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord \n\u0022Our time here is to  be short. We have much to do in little time. If we encounter the Empire you are to defeat them swiftly.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022Fool! What if these Elves that we seek do not wish to join the Alliance? What are we to do then just turn away and leave!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord \n\u0022That is why you are not a Lord and I am. Stop being foolish, you will follow my orders and do as I say!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022Do not call me a fool, my \u0022Lord\u0022 or you shall find yourself on the receiving end of my rage! This Alliance does not need these Elves! What we need is to establish power! If these Elves refuse what are we to do!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord  \n\u0022If these Elves refuse our generous offer then in the name of Gallean we will do what we must. We will eradicate them and loot their possessions. We cannot afford to be too generous during these trying times!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "ELF - CAP - BANTHER",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Esmonia Elf Ranger  \n\u0022The Elven Alliance! So it is true out of the dark the little Elves seek to organize a force to combat the Undead Hordes!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022You would be wise not to speak to us in such a belittling manner. The Elven Alliance is the future!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Ranger \n\u0022Oh we Esmonia Elves have thought about the future. Power! This is what we need and the Elven Alliance is nothing more than a sad attempt to soothe some bruised egos! We have found power!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Silence! I shall not hear anymore. The Elven Alliance is the force that will create an order of Elves! Your cynical words have made my mind up for me. You will not be enlisted into the Alliance. Instead you will greet Gallean in the after life!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "ELF - CAP - SHADYA",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord Of The Elven Alliance \n\u0022These Elves that we are seeking to enlist into the Alliance are corrupt! We will continue to destroy these miscreants in the name of the Alliance!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - ELF WIN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022We have taken control of all the trading ports within Mercantile. Inform Serphis that we may start preparing our fleet for the invasion of Fardale.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258UN003d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - EMPIRE WIN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Myzrael \n\u0022All trading ports have been secured. Contact the Emry at once and request support. We shall not give these Elves a second chance.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A - INTRO - EMPIRE",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Soldier \n\u0022Sir, there are reports that the Elven Alliance are in the region. What is your command?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight  \n\u0022The Elven Alliance are here to recruit the Elves in this region. It is not in the Empire\u0027s interest to have a strong Elven Alliance. We will show the Elven Alliance that it was a mistake to come here. We will conquer the region!\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "EMP - CAP - BANTHER",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Esmonia Centaur Lancer \n\u0022Bow down to the fiery power of the Legions Of The Damned! In exchange for their protection we will remain free from the Empire and the broken down Elven Alliance!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "EMP - CAP - SHADYA",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Esmonia Elf Ranger  \n\u0022The Empire must leave at once a great evil will be released if you continue to stay!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022What evil are you talking about? It matters not, the Empire will claim Esmonia for our own! Whatever evil you speak of will be decimated by us!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "EMP - CAP - DEVIL",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arch-Devil \n\u0022Esmonia and the Elves belong to the Legions Of The Damned! Our sorcery and witch craft will see to it that none that oppose us will remain!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Esmonia Warning ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Esmonia Centaur Charger \n\u0022Esmonia does not want the Empire here. Leave now peacefully or we will declare war! We will defend our realm!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Healing ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Angel \n\u0022I come with a message! These waters contain purifying properties. They shall heal your injuries! For the glory of the Empire all Elves are to be decimated. Their allegiance matters not!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Healing Waters ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Healing Waters 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Esmonia Centaur Strider \n\u0022Leave us, we do not want to be apart of your foolish Alliance! We have found all the power that we need to protect ourselves!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord \n\u0022Can you not see that only together will the Elves be able to survive in this mad world! The Elven Alliance is where you belong! Only together as a unified group can we withstand the onslaught of our enemies. This is Gallean\u0027s will!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elven Alliance Centaur Lancer \n\u0022What shall we do now oh wise \u0027Lord?\u0027 Did I not tell you that these Esmonia Elves would resist?\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord \n\u0022Quiet you fool! There is something else that is amiss here. I must dwell on that later. For the moment I must tell you that this area has been blessed by Gallean. Bring our battered forces here and they shall be healed!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Healing Waters ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Help",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Esmonia Oracle Elf \n\u0022Help me! Please I need help! Save me and you shall have the treasure in the cave!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Baalhu the Arch-Devil \n\u0022None shall have this treasure! Little Elf you have done well leading them into our trap!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Crone Warning ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Esmonia Elf \n\u0022The time has come for you to join us! Esmonia is our home and it can be yours too. Cease your actions and accept that Esmonian Elves are your Leige. Accept a life of servitude in Esmonia!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S258UN004a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S258SC0000",
